<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Turn Me Up</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Sick Joy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Turn Me Up</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6d5YLQel1T5HgdRgeTtz1O</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.000" end="00:08.000">"You got enough but you always want more</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.140" end="00:19.800">You only what you've already had before</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.800" end="00:26.040">I feel the heat when you're cold inside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.040" end="00:32.760">I've gotta run I've got nowhere left to hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.760" end="00:35.700">I can feel something</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.700" end="00:39.060">It's coming on like a fever over me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.060" end="00:43.620">I'm feeling nothing like myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.620" end="00:48.420">So turn me up right now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.420" end="00:54.810">You make them sweat make them trip for real</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.810" end="01:01.050">You've got no mind got a tongue of silver steel</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.050" end="01:07.650">Please oh please I've gotta get out</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.650" end="01:14.370">And you've been killing with the best intentions now</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.370" end="01:17.310">I can feel something</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.310" end="01:25.310">It's coming on  like  a fever over me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.260" end="01:50.790">I'm feeling nothing like myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.790" end="01:54.790">So turn me up right now"</p></div></body></tt>